OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMost UK diplomats to leave East
OL,4,AJerusalem consulate, Israel says, as
OL,5,AMiliband says 'vital services' to
OL,6,Aremain
OL,7,
OL,8,FUK Foreign Secretary Ed Miliband
OL,9,Fresponded that some staff had been
OL,10,F"temporarily withdrawn" for security
OL,11,Freasons, and stressed the mission would
OL,12,Fcontinue "our work with the Palestinian
OL,13,Fpeople".
OL,15,FIsrael said in September it would shut
OL,16,Fthe consulate in retaliation for UK
OL,17,Fsanctions on Israeli settlements in the
OL,18,Foccupied West Bank, which are illegal
OL,19,Funder international law.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
